    "A cube that won't hold its shape. Pres": {
      "truth": "A cube that won't hold its shape. Press it, drop it, watch it recover — or not. The jelly cube is a spring-mass system: particles connected by elastic constraints, each one pulling its neighbors back toward rest.",
